    description: "PlazaFlow Cohort 1: 231 TS commands.xxx() calls to 110 Rust #[tauri::command] functions produce zero cross-language edges. Tauri IPC is the architectural spine of every Tauri app. User is building plazaflow (a Tauri app), making this the highest-priority linker gap. Needs: (1) detect #[tauri::command] attribute on Rust functions, (2) detect invoke('command_name') calls in TS/JS, (3) create ipc_calls edges between them. Also handle tauri-specta patterns. Affects spacedrive, yaak, Cap, readest in bakeoff."  # 7f56
